OL,3,GNEWSAWhy players are returning to      
OL,4,ASubbuteo decades after giving it up    
OL,6,FFor many people, Subbuteo is a         
OL,7,Fchildhood memory.                      
OL,9,FA game of flicked footballers,         
OL,10,Fgrandstands and green baize pitches    
OL,11,Fthat was left behind as video games    
OL,12,Ftook over.                             
OL,14,FBut this weekend, 23 clubs from across 
OL,15,Fthe UK and Ireland will descend on     
OL,16,FCoventry for one of the biggest events 
OL,17,Fin the tabletop football calendar.     
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
